        "text": "To be fair this looks more like a prototype than a polished embodiment.  Besides the obvious (better labels), one way to make the UI user friendly would be to put the solution details near the relevant boxes.\n\nOne fair critique of nodes+wires is a tendency to get tangled.  Even in this little example, I count roughly a dozen crossings in roughly that many edges.",
